h1 About our website.
h2 Start by clicking on the PHOTOS button on the Main Menu. You will get a list of years down the Leftside Navigation Bar, and be shown where you came from 'Photos' in the Alternate Navigation Bar (just below the Main Menu). Click on the year you want to see. Again, the Leftside Navigation Bar shows you where you can go from here, and the Alternate Navigation Bar shows where you came from. When you want to get back to one of the pages you came from, just click on that menu item on the Alternate Navigation Bar. You should NOT use the back-arrow on your browser to go back one page. It will take you all the way back to the beginning of the Photos.  
